{"at":"2026-11-01T09:27:40.442Z","type":"result","sequence":4,"path":"/Users/pelicannurse/.t3/projects/first-person-shooter-soul-game/docs/media/build32-review1/controls.jpg","captureMs":101.09170900000026,"beforePause":{"phase":"dialog","dialog":"OPERATOR HANDBOOK\n×\nMOVE WITH PURPOSE.\nW A S D\nMove\nMOUSE\nLook\nLMB\nFire coil rifle\nRMB\nAim down sights\nR\nReload\nSHIFT\nSoul Shift / dash\nCTRL\nSprint\nSPACE\nJump\nHOLD E\nRecover nearby memory\nESC\nPause / release mouse\n\nSoul Shift protects briefly. Dash within 4.5 m of a charging enemy to cancel its shot and stagger it for 0.8 s. A blue emitter flash confirms the break. Dashing toward a charge stops early on a successful break so you can follow up. Sideways dodges retain full travel. It deals no damage; the 4.5 s cooldown still applies. Your shield regenerates when you avoid damage.\n\nTHREAT VISOR · Orange optic bracket: charging. Muted: recent fire/hit. Lower readout follows one target near aim. Bearing chevrons merge enemy types: CHARGES counts charging enemies; SOURCES counts all eligible enemies there. Individual types/histories are omitted in groups. Clear optic line of sight required; cues expire. Full memories remain in the archive.\n\nUNDERSTOOD\n↗"},"after":{"phase":"dialog","dialog":"OPERATOR HANDBOOK\n×\nMOVE WITH PURPOSE.\nW A S D\nMove\nMOUSE\nLook\nLMB\nFire coil rifle\nRMB\nAim down sights\nR\nReload\nSHIFT\nSoul Shift / dash\nCTRL\nSprint\nSPACE\nJump\nHOLD E\nRecover nearby memory\nESC\nPause / release mouse\n\nSoul Shift protects briefly. Dash within 4.5 m of a charging enemy to cancel its shot and stagger it for 0.8 s. A blue emitter flash confirms the break. Dashing toward a charge stops early on a successful break so you can follow up. Sideways dodges retain full travel. It deals no damage; the 4.5 s cooldown still applies. Your shield regenerates when you avoid damage.\n\nTHREAT VISOR · Orange optic bracket: charging. Muted: recent fire/hit. Lower readout follows one target near aim. Bearing chevrons merge enemy types: CHARGES counts charging enemies; SOURCES counts all eligible enemies there. Individual types/histories are omitted in groups. Clear optic line of sight required; cues expire. Full memories remain in the archive.\n\nUNDERSTOOD\n↗"},"clientMs":178.48816600000282,"pageErrors":[]}
